      "mentions": 39,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated avian and exotic specialists"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise the veterinarians and veterinary technicians for their specialised knowledge in treating birds, reptiles, and small mammals. Multiple reviewers commend clinicians like Dr Lamb, Dr Willig, and Dr Asrow for their thorough diagnostic exams and compassionate care. Clients describe an attentive team that takes genuine interest in unconventional pets."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 28,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle treatment for exotic species"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how comfortably and carefully exotic species—including cockatoos, hens, chameleons, tortoises, ferrets, and geckos—are handled during consultations. While one reviewer expressed grief over the loss of their bearded dragon, the vast majority of clients appreciate the calm, low-stress techniques employed by the veterinary staff during exams."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Prompt scheduling for urgent ailments"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently remark on how quickly appointments are arranged when exotic pets suffer sudden illnesses or injuries. Reviewers appreciate that urgent conditions such as seizures, bleeding injuries, or respiratory distress are accommodated without delay. Although one reviewer experienced scheduling frustrations, most pet parents report punctual visits."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What types of exotic pets are treated at the hospital?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The clinic provides veterinary medical care for birds, reptiles, ferrets, rabbits, rodents, tortoises, and small mammals."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are emergency appointments available for sick exotic animals?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients report that the team accommodated urgent emergencies including seizures, egg-binding, and eye trauma."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Do the clinicians offer wellness exams for senior exotic pets?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet parents regularly bring older ferrets, parrots, and reptiles for comprehensive wellness checks and monitoring."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are payment plans or financing options accepted?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers note that the hospital offers affordable treatment plans and accommodates financing options for medical procedures."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
